# write(0), wait 400 ms, write(180), wait 500 ms, write(0). The first pulse is at
# about 53 ms. By 250 ms the shaft has reached 0° and the 5 V diode is at idle.
# By 550 ms it is slewing toward 180°, and by 800 ms it is there.
open
step 250ms
expect @servo.angle < 1deg
expect @nano.diode.i < 40mA
step 300ms
expect @servo.angle > 55deg
expect @servo.angle < 70deg
expect @nano.diode.i > 100mA
step 250ms
expect @servo.angle > 179deg
expect no diagnostics
